# Debris Field Crusher: "When this Spacecraft enters, it deals 3 damage to any target" (Bot2 goes 20 to 17). "Station ... 8+ | Flying", printed 1/5: on turn 3 Bot1 taps Phyrexian Soulgorger (power 8) to station it, and it is a 1/5 artifact creature with flying. "{1}{R}: This Spacecraft gets +2/+0 until end of turn." makes it 3/5, the toughness unchanged, and it is a 1/5 again from the next turn (CR 702.184a, 721.2b, 611.2).

